Hi! This is StatePort — a place on your own computer where the work you do with AI can live. Let me show you what that means, in about a minute.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:19.183
This is one of those projects. Instead of hiding inside a chat, it
This is one of those projects. Instead of hiding inside a chat, it keeps its own notes: what the goal is, what happened so far, and what needs your attention next.

00:00:19.633 --> 00:00:36.289
You can still chat with an AI helper — here it is called a coding
You can still chat with an AI helper — here it is called a coding agent. StatePort runs it through a managed workspace on your machine. A job can use a sandbox or container when you configure one. The agent gets bounded tools and permissions, and asks before anything important changes.

00:00:36.739 --> 00:00:44.731
